 "captions": {
  "segments": [
   {
    "src": "https://storage.googleapis.com/xi-backend/database/workspace/7cc47f07542244198929ee3028fc0974/content_generation/fxBgF9q06SpIDl8eq5cL/vl7U4OnfeVIFYQJ5QIUU/content.mp3?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256&X-Goog-Credential=xi-backend-prod%40xi-labs.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20261030%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request&X-Goog-Date=20261030T070251Z&X-Goog-Expires=7200&X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host&X-Goog-",
    "start": 0.3,
    "script": "At three thirty-three A.M.... I called myself. My phone rang. The caller I.D. said... Mia. Watch the clock. Scientists have a theory: deja vu is a tiny misfire in the brain's memory system. A brand-new moment... feels already lived. So I answered."
   },
   {
    "src": "https://storage.googleapis.com/xi-backend/database/workspace/7cc47f07542244198929ee3028fc0974/content_generation/pFYsevTCPDEZxtNlnTy7/oR07QzWXmnjAoR3kSFwO/content.mp3?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256&X-Goog-Credential=xi-backend-prod%40xi-labs.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20261030%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request&X-Goog-Date=20261030T070250Z&X-Goog-Expires=7200&X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host&X-Goog-",
    "start": 21.8,
    "script": "Don't look at the clock, Mia."
   },
   {
    "src": "https://storage.googleapis.com/xi-backend/database/workspace/7cc47f07542244198929ee3028fc0974/content_generation/LAZcsftk9ae5WZaScuO7/vjJjrs35MzbDse0MMEcb/content.mp3?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256&X-Goog-Credential=xi-backend-prod%40xi-labs.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20261030%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request&X-Goog-Date=20261030T070254Z&X-Goog-Expires=7200&X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host&X-Goog-",
    "start": 24.4,
    "script": "That was my voice. Saying words... I hadn't said yet. I looked at the clock. It went back. Three seconds. And my phone... rang again."
   }
